sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser
    participant A as FastAPI API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/pgvector
    participant O as Ollama

    U->>A: POST /api/v1/ask + X-API-Key
    A->>DB: SELECT API key FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>A: key + current fixed window
    A->>DB: atomically increment or reject
    alt limit exceeded
        A-->>U: 429 + Retry-After
    else allowed
        A->>O: embed(query)
        O-->>A: query vector
        A->>DB: exact cosine top 5 chunks
        DB-->>A: retrieval results
        alt no context
            A-->>U: Недостаточно данных + []
        else context exists
            A->>O: grounded prompt + chunks
            O-->>A: answer text
            A-->>U: answer + sources built from retrieval
        end
    end
